Subject: [PATCH] docs: add AGENTS.md with the repo's rules; delete CLAUDE.md

Ports the Inspector's AGENTS.md shape, keeping only rules that are true
on v2/main today: project structure, development setup and pre-push
checks for both languages, branch table, contributing (issues, not PRs,
with a temporary Dependabot exception to "every PR references an issue"),
maintenance rules, issue-driven board rules for #43, review etiquette,
testing baseline, waiting on long-running work, MCP protocol idioms, and
TypeScript and Python instructions.

Every CLAUDE.md section is mapped per the inception doc's section 4, and
CLAUDE.md is deleted with no pointer file: Claude Code reads AGENTS.md
directly. src/everything/AGENTS.md keeps only its server-specific
guidance; its generic style rules moved to the root file, since a nested
AGENTS.md loads only when a file in that directory is read.

Closes #4862

